2026-09-20 04:55:13,845 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] ### Conclusion:
2026-09-20 04:55:13,845 INFO mulder.orchestrator.display: [dashboard] RM3 optical media analysis reveals a sophisticated data exfiltration operation using multiple obfuscation techniques across 9 burn sessions. The suspect burned White House OMB and Library of Congress documents (previously staged on RM2 with counterfeit extensions) to optical media, then progressively renamed directories to abbreviated forms and deleted files to hide evidence. The final disc shows only innocuous sample images, but forensic analysis of earlier sessions exposes ~107 MB of government documents embedded with White House and LOC identifiers. This confirms the same data theft across multiple exfiltration mediums (RM2 removable media and RM3 optical disc) as part of a coordinated insider threat operation.
